{
  "id": "section-837",
  "title": "接见在京部队时的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-217.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>217)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　下次接见，采取阅兵式的办法。不管多少人，解放军要统统包下来，经过训练，把解放军的光荣传统、三八作风、三大纪律、八项注意，带到全国各地去。三大纪律八项注意歌，人人要会唱，我也要会唱。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-216.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-218.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
